e-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_240923/66f157004ff18.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_240923/66f157004ff18.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">特巴斯紧接着转发了这条官方声明，并再度给予回应。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-23/6ab2bbc54a7f4native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">承认误判！西裁委：李刚仁飞铲应直红 赫伊森红点罗梅罗黄牌无误</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260921/6ab096be28da3_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260921/6ab096be28da3.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260921/6ab096be28da3.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">西班牙足协发布了西裁委（CTA）最新一期的判罚回顾视频，其中回顾了西甲第7轮马德里德比中出现的多项争议判罚。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-23/6ab2b3afd3790native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">亚马尔完整专访：不想成为梅罗|想成为自己|想拿3座欧冠5座金球</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-23/6ab2aa693ba14native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">亚马尔：踢球方式是我竞争金球的最强论据；世界杯冠军显然有加分</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260923/202609230117488797_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260923/202609230117488797_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260923/202609230117488797_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">距离金球奖揭晓还有一个月，巴萨球星亚马尔接受了法国《队报》的专访，谈到了自己的性格、金球奖竞争、世界杯经历以及未来的目标。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-22/6ab2953fc8e6anative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">德布劳内：我和范博梅尔只完成一次合练，大概能理解他想要的打法</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260910/6aa1ccff201b7_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260910/6aa1ccff201b7_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260910/6aa1ccff201b7_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">德布劳内回归国家队集训时出席新闻发布会，他谈到了新教练、自身角色、国家队新一代年轻球员、世界杯回忆、那不勒斯近况与个人状态。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-22/6ab29be4428afnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">若昂·佩德罗：续约切尔西不只是因为过往成绩，还因为理想和目标</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data=