6-09-23/6ab2a56c463danative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">😷多家法媒：姆巴佩出现类似流感症状，未参加法国今日训练</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260719/6a5bfbe0815ef_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260719/6a5bfbe0815ef.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260719/6a5bfbe0815ef.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">据队报、Footmercato等多家法媒报道，齐达内当地时间周二带领法国队进行自己上任后的第二次训练课，但姆巴佩因病缺席。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-23/6ab2a8c6ae529native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">他留下！DO：阿尔特塔同意与阿森纳续约，合同待遇将有所提高</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260908/6a9f1337de6a7_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260908/6a9f1337de6a7.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260908/6a9f1337de6a7.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">据The